[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0010","text":"……好的，完全没问题\n谢谢您～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0020","text":"对了\n果穗小姐，这个给您"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0030","text":"这是感谢您提早交文件的谢礼♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0040","text":"谢谢您——！\n那我收下了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0050","text":"啊，制作人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0060","text":"哦，果穗也来交文件吗？\n叶月小姐，这个也麻烦您确认一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0070","text":"好的────这个是，截止日期在下下周的文件呢\n谢谢您～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0080","text":"──那么，制作人也来一个吧\n这是感谢您提早提交的谢礼～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0090","text":"……！！\n嘿嘿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0100","text":"哈哈……那我就不客气了\n感觉赚到了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_39000300_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
